"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","review_id":"x2y2bhe7kQd7HIvKgowhvA","date":"2020-10-17T05:07:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9306803941726685,"text_excerpt":"I love everything about this bar. The entire place is gorgeous, staff is kind and accommodating. The drinks are sooo good, the foods great. We essentially sampled every cocktail of the menu tonight and they were all strong but very tasteful with great ingredients. Right now only the patio portion is open and they do require reservations but it was easy to get one last minute for a table of four"},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","review_id":"Z8Q7qixE69CRY4ZRbXaHrA","date":"2021-11-05T03:09:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9274253249168396,"text_excerpt":"We had an unbelievable Saturday brunch here out on the patio. We ordered a few delicious cocktails and got to it! The service was amazing, too - the entire staff was really attentive and friendly. We started with some killer buttermilk biscuits and butter, because why not? They ruled. Then, we split a few main courses. The first was Eggs in Purgatory, which I was a bit unsure of but ended up loving. Ricotta, tomato sauce, and killer crispy bread to dip. Awesome. We also go the poached eggs and grits, which was really unique. It had all these layers to the flavor, including mustard greens and more. Loved it, too. Finally, the snapper tartar which was really light and tasty, as well. We abs..."},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","review_id":"_MkMc_6hoeKi5_IgralJHA","date":"2018-12-08T17:36:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9272530674934387,"text_excerpt":"Super cute new bar with some really great offerings. Came here for drinks after work and couldn't believe how cozy and welcoming it felt. I wish it had been warmer so we could enjoy the courtyard walled in on one side by a church and it's beautiful stained glass windows. My friend and I said we weren't going to eat but once we saw the menu we had to try the Brussel sprouts and whipped Ricotta. The Brussel sprouts were amazing, I mean maybe some of the best I've had. Whipped ricotta with warm flat bread was also really yum. I thought the cocktails at $9 were fairly priced for a place like this, and really enjoyed the daiquiri. They had 2 fires going in the fireplaces in the front room maki..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","photo_id":"mS_JLadWiSKPTXdb2W9Gfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mS_JLadWiSKPTXdb2W9Gfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8805735111236572},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","photo_id":"zheq9U_1_upBisBpWxgcNw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/zheq9U_1_upBisBpWxgcNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8489394783973694},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","photo_id":"B40EL-_7oaRIz71LNyynfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/B40EL-_7oaRIz71LNyynfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8298648595809937},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","photo_id":"7kV0S0fbb0ByoxUPTNT_wA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7kV0S0fbb0ByoxUPTNT_wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8179416060447693},{"business_id":"rvF-BwyaCHeb30u3Xf7FbQ","photo_id":"nK1W3N677Xa5B4jnOPoBzQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nK1W3N677Xa5B4jnOPoBzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8174884915351868}]},"notebook_case":null}
